<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header', { page: 'policy' }) %>

<div class="page-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="prose"><h1><%= pageTitle %></h1></div></div></div>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:16px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 3 September 2026</p>

      <p>This policy explains cancellations and refunds for paid plans of the Power Tools for Coaches suite by DivineLeads.</p>

      <h2>1. Free to start</h2>
      <p>All tools are free to start. You can explore the Services without payment, so you can evaluate a tool before upgrading.</p>

      <h2>2. Cancellation</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You may cancel a paid subscription at any time from your account or by contacting us.</li>
        <li>On cancellation, your plan remains active until the end of the current billing period; it will not renew after that.</li>
        <li>Cancelling stops future charges but does not, by itself, trigger a refund of amounts already paid, except as set out below.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Refunds</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>7-day consideration window.</b> If you upgrade to a paid plan and are not satisfied, you may request a refund within 7 days of the charge, provided the service has not been substantially used or abused.</li>
        <li>Refunds are not available for: renewals after the plan has been used during the period; usage-based charges already consumed (for example, emails already sent or transfers already completed); or accounts terminated for breach of our <a href="/terms">Terms</a>.</li>
        <li>Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method within 5–10 business days, subject to your bank or payment provider's timelines.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. How to request</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:<%= contact.email %>?subject=Refund%20request"><%= contact.email %></a> with your account email, the tool name in the subject line, and the reason for your request, or WhatsApp <a href="<%= contact.waLink %>"><%= contact.wa %></a>. We aim to respond within 3 business days.</p>

      <h2>5. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The version in effect at the time of your purchase applies to that purchase.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
